0131zca okumak ve daha sonra %s sekmesinden ba\u011flamak i\u00e7in bunu kapat\u0131n."],"The installation could not start.":["Kurulum ba\u015flat\u0131lamad\u0131."],"Start":["Ba\u015flat"],"The installation is done.":["Kurulum tamamland\u0131."],"The installation stopped.":["Kurulum durdu."],"Version %s":["S\u00fcr\u00fcm %s"],"Premium":["Premium"],"Related Posts settings":["Related Posts ayarlar\u0131"],"Unsaved changes":["Kaydedilmemi\u015f de\u011fi\u015fiklikler"],"You have unsaved changes.":["Kaydedilmemi\u015f de\u011fi\u015fiklikleriniz var."],"Discard":["Vazge\u00e7"],"Settings saved.":["Ayarlar kaydedildi."],"The settings could not be saved.":["Ayarlar kaydedilemedi."],"Save changes":["De\u011fi\u015fiklikleri kaydet"],"This page does not exist.":["Bu sayfa mevcut de\u011fil."],"Restore default":["Varsay\u0131lana d\u00f6nd\u00fcr"],"This option is overwritten by a filter.":["Bu se\u00e7enek bir filtre taraf\u0131ndan ge\u00e7ersiz k\u0131l\u0131n\u0131yor."],"An installation is running. You can start another one when it is done.":["Bir kurulum \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor. O tamamland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda yenisini ba\u015flatabilirsiniz."],"Link new posts":["Yeni yaz\u0131lar\u0131 ba\u011fla"],"Read and link the posts that are not linked yet, for example posts from before automatic linking was on. Links that exist stay as they are.":["Hen\u00fcz ba\u011flanmam\u0131\u015f yaz\u0131lar\u0131, \u00f6rne\u011fin otomatik ba\u011flama a\u00e7\u0131lmadan \u00f6nceki yaz\u0131lar\u0131 okuyun ve ba\u011flay\u0131n. Mevcut ba\u011flant\u0131lar oldu\u011fu gibi kal\u0131r."],"Rebuild everything":["Her \u015feyi yeniden olu\u015ftur"],"Start over: remove every related post link, also the links you added by hand, read all posts again and link them. Your posts themselves are never touched.":["Ba\u015ftan ba\u015flay\u0131n: elle ekledi\u011finiz ba\u011flant\u0131lar dahil t\u00fcm ilgili yaz\u0131 ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n, t\u00fcm yaz\u0131lar\u0131 yeniden okuyun ve ba\u011flay\u0131n. Yaz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n kendisine asla dokunulmaz."],"Rebuild everything?":["Her \u015fey yeniden olu\u015fturulsun mu?"],"Remove links and rebuild":["Ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 kald\u0131r ve yeniden olu\u015ftur"],"Keep my links":["Ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131m\u0131 koru"],"Every related post link is removed, including the links you added by hand. This can not be undone.":["Elle ekledi\u011finiz ba\u011flant\u0131lar dahil t\u00fcm ilgili yaz\u0131 ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz."]}}}